    "output_token_ids_sha256": "256de707c20f64f6b09924d5db53ec387b04b46261c9b749f3772320fe75e6a7",
    "raw_output": "```javascript\nexports.coalesceRanges = function(values) {\n  if (!Array.isArray(values)) {\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  const result = [];\n  let i = 0;\n\n  while (i < values.length) {\n    const [start, end] = values[i];\n\n    // Reject range unless start is strictly less than end\n    if (start >= end) {\n      i++;\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    // If result is empty or the new range starts before the last range ended,\n    // we must merge.\n    if (result.length === 0 || start < result[result.length - 1][1]) {\n      const last = result[result.length - 1];\n      const newStart = Math.min(last[0], start);\n      const newEnd = Math.max(last[1], end);\n      result.push([newStart, newEnd]);\n    } else {\n      result.push([start, end]);\n    }\n\n    i++;\n  }\n\n  return result;\n};\n```<|im_end|>",
